# Mail subscriptions (docs/architecture.md, "Mail subscriptions"). Signs every confirm and
# unsubscribe link, so it must not be the cookie secret. At least 32 printable characters:
# openssl rand -base64 48. Unset in production turns subscriptions off; with ENV=dev, unset signs
# with a public development value.
SUBSCRIBERS_SECRET=age64:
